            {
              "name": "Prompt",
              "data": {
                "name": "subaward-summary-consolidation",
                "prompt": "You are assembling the Subaward Agreement Extraction output.\nThe input is the JSON fragment produced by the upstream six\nparallel Extraction tasks. Your job is to emit a single JSON\nobject that validates against the\nsubaward-extraction-udm@0.1.0 schema.\n\nRules:\n1. For each of the six contact fields (pte_pi, pte_admin_contact,\n   pte_financial_contact, subrecipient_pi,\n   subrecipient_admin_contact, subrecipient_financial_contact),\n   compose a single object {name, email, phone} from the three\n   corresponding searchset items. When the name is missing,\n   set the entire contact field to null.\n2. cost_type and invoicing_frequency must use enum values\n   exactly. Normalize document phrasings to the closest enum.\n3. Verify CFR-01 reconciliation: amount_funded ==\n   total_direct_costs + total_indirect_costs when all three\n   are present. When they do not reconcile, preserve the\n   document's reported values rather than synthesizing.\n4. technical_reports, financial_reports, and invention_reporting\n   are typed arrays. Empty array when the agreement does not\n   require any.\n5. governing_regulations is required and must list every\n   governing instrument with its source attribution.\n6. Use null for missing scalar fields; never invent values.\n   Quote emails and phone numbers character-perfectly.\n7. Do not output any text outside the single JSON object.",
                "input_source": "step_input"
              }
            }
          ]
